{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"electronic devices\" electronics computers smartphones) (+ \"contribute to climate change\" \"causes global warming\" \"greenhouse gas emissions\") (+ electricity manufacturing \"e-waste\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_928338278#11_1979115019","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2211","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_928338278#11_1979115019\" , \"end_char\": 6925.000000 , \"headings\": \"Secure E-waste, Hard Drive, Lamp & Battery 1 Stop Recycling ​Chicago's Largest Pick Up Service Secure E-waste, Hard Drive, Lamp & Battery 1 Stop Recycling Free Drive Destruction - Secure Handling - Responsible Recycling - Certified Services \" , \"segment\": \"Recycling domestic <cover>electronics conserves our natural resources and helps to reduce air and water pollution. It also helps to cut down greenhouse gas emissions that are by-products of mining and manufacturing </cover>virgin materials. New Government laws (Environmental Protection Agency) now require for all electronic and electrical goods to be disposed of in a properly controlled manner. This has led to a lot of businesses opening up offering recycling services. The services provided by these companies will differ from one company to the next and may include the following: Free electronics equipment pick up Computer and server hard drive data destruction Certificate of recycling provided Provide drop off centres for electronics equipment Organise and run recycling events for neighbourhoods, churches and corporate organizations Why Recycle: It is "}}
