{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"wasting energy\" \"energy waste\" \"save electricity\") (+ computers electronics appliances devices) (+ \"greenhouse gases\" \"carbon dioxide\" emissions) (+ \"global warming\" \"climate change\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_05_440662621#27_598895783","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2234","rank":1,"snippet":"Your Car 39. Drive Less or Carpool 40. Take Public Transit 41. Buy Carbon Offsets when you Fly 42. Ride Your Bike 43. Work From Home at least a day a Week 44. Get Home Energy Audit Done 45. Become Part of the Global Warming Community 46. Celebrate Arbor Day and Earth day 47. Become Aware of Your Contribution 48. Spread the Awareness About Rinkesh \" , \"segment\": \"READ What are Various <cover>Global Warming Solutions? 19. Replace Filters on Air Conditioner and Furnace If you still haven’t, then you are wasting energy but breathing in dirty air. Cleaning a dirty air filter can save several pounds of carbon dioxide a year. 20. Go Green Using energy star appliances </cover>will not only save money but also the amount of energy wasted in your home. Have a look at various ways to go green. 21. Download Earth Saving Apps Apps like Kil-Ur-Watts and Wiser EMS not only help calculate your energy costs but provide tools and ways to save energy and money. 22.\" , \"start_char\": 7948.000000 , \"title\": \"45+ Easy and Simple Ways "}}
