{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_53_622938489#1_1304625055","relevance":1,"reason":"This solar-company passage discusses electricity costs, renewable energy, climate change, and extreme weather, but it does not explain that electronics use causes emissions, climate change, or natural disasters.","learned":"Solar/electric-bill pages may mention extreme weather and electricity consumption, but not the causal chain from electronics use to disasters."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"things in your house\" appliances electronics computers) (+ \"cause global warming\" \"greenhouse gas emissions\") (+ \"extreme weather\" \"natural disasters\" hurricanes droughts floods))","reason":"Target household-appliance/electronic-device global-warming pages while forcing extreme-weather/natural-disaster consequences, hoping to find a full causal explanation in one document."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"things in your house\" appliances electronics computers) (+ \"cause global warming\" \"greenhouse gas emissions\") (+ \"extreme weather\" \"natural disasters\" hurricanes droughts floods))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_919152897#3_1832429525","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2237","rank":3,"snippet":"\"headings\": \"Building Services Building Services NEW HOURS: Records and history \" , \"segment\": \"Energy and Innovation - The building safety industry is on the cutting edge of energy efficiency, building science and innovation. Energy fuels our lives yet, energy use and associate <cover>greenhouse gas emissions can pose significant challenges to our communities. Training the next generation - Well-trained, motivated building safety professionals are key to creating and maintaining a successful community. Training is important because it helps code officials avoid mistakes and accidents and properly enforce the code. Water safety - Clean water is the world’s most precious commodity. Building, plumbing and green codes help guard this precious commodity for future generations through proper construction, conservation and safe disposal. Disaster Preparedness - The power of natural disasters can be overwhelming. Protecting homes can range from taking simple measures like protecting windows or elevating appliances, </cover>to more complete building retrofit measures. Building Services has reduced staffing due to revenue shortfalls. Permits, inspections, reports, applications and other services – including returning phone calls and emails – may take longer than usual.\" , \"start_char\": 1548.000000 , \"title\": \"","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1263986546#8_2309048847","rank":1,"relevance":1},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1263986546#9_2309050602","rank":2,"relevance":1}]}}
